264
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:28,120
By moving from five to six, from Wednesday to Thursday,

265
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:31,410
you've moved up a year for the scoring.

266
00:11:31,410 --> 00:11:33,410
Because they go by year, not by day.

267
00:11:33,410 --> 00:11:36,940
So if you would have scored 120 on the IQ test yesterday,

268
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:38,890
when they say what should you have scored for a

269
00:11:38,890 --> 00:11:41,630
five-year-old, the very same test, the next day,

270
00:11:41,630 --> 00:11:43,590
you would score 100.

