316
00:13:33,330 --> 00:13:36,450
Because IQ tests correlate with GPA in high school and

317
00:13:36,450 --> 00:13:39,910
college, job success, salary, stable marriages, staying out

318
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:42,340
of jail, and how long you live.

319
00:13:42,340 --> 00:13:43,380
Again, it's a correlation.

320
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:45,645
It could be many different things.

321
00:13:45,645 --> 00:13:48,250
The thing I want to talk you out of is the idea that if you

322
00:13:48,250 --> 00:13:52,985
