340
00:14:28,890 --> 00:14:31,250
But it's about as big a chunk as you can get for a couple

341
00:14:31,250 --> 00:14:32,300
hours of testing.

342
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:35,290
And we know that other things like personality, variation,

343
00:14:35,290 --> 00:14:38,210
education, culture, all those things blend in on how a

344
00:14:38,210 --> 00:14:40,775
person will do on all these outcomes.

345
00:14:43,630 --> 00:14:44,720
So I'm going to go back and forth.

346
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:45,850
Because on the one hand, we say there's a lot of stuff

