00:14:48,010 --> 00:14:49,040
nobody would talk about it.

350
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:50,260
And it would just disappear from the world.

351
00:14:50,260 --> 00:14:55,790
So on average, on average, what does 15 IQ points mean?

352
00:14:55,790 --> 00:14:58,640
So on average, a person with 100 IQ in the US will go to

353
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:00,660
high school and a year or two in a community college.

354
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:04,560
On average, these are averages over huge variety of people.

355
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:07,120
You get 15 more IQ points, and on average, you're likely to

356
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:09,630
finish college and have a white collar job.

357
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:11,890
Have 15 fewer points, and you're not likely to complete

358
00:15:11,890 --> 00:15:12,700
high school.

