00:15:32,210 --> 00:15:32,970
environment?

367
00:15:32,970 --> 00:15:34,790
Where does that come from?

368
00:15:34,790 --> 00:15:37,930
What are the things that support us or limit us?

369
00:15:37,930 --> 00:15:42,970
So here's one study that took women from the same family.

370
00:15:42,970 --> 00:15:45,800
So they're all sisters from the same family.

371
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:48,690
They're trying to control a little bit of the genetics,

372
00:15:48,690 --> 00:15:50,220
