373
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:51,280
They're not twins.

374
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:53,360
And definitely shared environment.

375
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,760
They're in the same household.

376
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:59,320
And within those families, they look at the IQ scores.

377
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:02,580
So here's the average group, above average, well above

378
00:16:02,580 --> 00:16:05,760
average, a little below average, a lot below average.

379
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:09,330
And they say that in these women, all coming from the

