1371
00:57:09,730 --> 00:57:14,270
So here's an incredibly powerful and important idea.

1372
00:57:14,270 --> 00:57:16,865
Claude Steele is a researcher at Stanford, who I knew, who

1373
00:57:16,865 --> 00:57:19,100
