1398
00:58:14,790 --> 00:58:15,530
So what is this?

1399
00:58:15,530 --> 00:58:18,380
This is understood as stereotype vulnerability.

1400
00:58:18,380 --> 00:58:23,580
That is, tragically in the US there's a stereotype that

1401
00:58:23,580 --> 00:58:26,680
African Americans are not as good

1402
00:58:26,680 --> 00:58:29,890
