at math, I'm only so good at programming, I'm only so good

1604
01:06:19,220 --> 01:06:21,700
of writing, or whatever, versus people who say, the

1605
01:06:21,700 --> 01:06:24,400
harder I work, the better I'll get.

1606
01:06:24,400 --> 01:06:27,300
And that pretty much, this work from Carol Dweck, that

1607
01:06:27,300 --> 01:06:30,090
many people tend to go for one thing or the other.

1608
01:06:30,090 --> 01:06:31,720
Is it are we born with talent and that's

