1612
01:06:36,500 --> 01:06:37,700
And so this is the kind of questionnaire.

1613
01:06:37,700 --> 01:06:39,280
And these are literally questions, so she gives

1614
01:06:39,280 --> 01:06:42,170
students, you have a certain amount of intelligence and you

1615
01:06:42,170 --> 01:06:43,360
