Here's the ones who believed they could get better.

1624
01:06:59,950 --> 01:07:02,140
Here's the ones who said they only have so much math ability

1625
01:07:02,140 --> 01:07:03,570
and intelligence.

1626
01:07:03,570 --> 01:07:05,050
And look at the ones who thought they could get better,

1627
01:07:05,050 --> 01:07:06,500
got better.

1628
01:07:06,500 --> 01:07:08,830
So that seems like a really good thing to have, is not

1629
01:07:08,830 --> 01:07:10,500
only the positive attitude.

1630
01:07:10,500 --> 01:07:14,540
But a real belief that the harder the work, the smarter

1631
01:07:14,540 --> 01:07:15,790
