01:11:04,390 --> 01:11:08,260
And imagine if you had done two years or five years?

1718
01:11:08,260 --> 01:11:10,730
And IQ in this case doesn't capture it at all.

1719
01:11:10,730 --> 01:11:13,310
There's something else in them that changed, that made them

1720
01:11:13,310 --> 01:11:16,730
